    // An Dong Market
    'an_dong_history_title': 'General Information & Formation History',
    'an_dong_history_content': 'An Dong Market is on An Duong Vuong Street, in the Cholon area, Ho Chi Minh City. Market formed around 1950-1954, associated with trading activities of the Chinese community. In 1954, the old market was built; in 1989, construction of the new market began and in 1991, the new market went into operation. Today, the market is a famous fashion trading hub.',
